{"base":"f7a4921ae7da4a033284005220f349b33fe240c8","description":"Hand-write changelog prose for releases\n\n- Accumulate notes under a persistent `## [Unreleased]` section in\n  CHANGELOG.md so prose can be edited between releases.\n- Replace the pre-release-hook that regenerated CHANGELOG.md with a\n  `pre-release-replacements` entry that rewrites `[Unreleased]` to the\n  version header at release time, folding it into the release commit.\n- Unify crate and binary release docs in RELEASE.md and link from the\n  README, since the flow now has a single entry point.\n\nWhy: `cargo release` previously regenerated CHANGELOG.md from commits\nonly, leaving no room for hand-written release notes. This keeps the\nauto-generated commit list as a starting point while giving humans\ncontrol over the final prose.","oid":"764a6b86476f15a3c328e03ae0824ab58357168f","type":"revision"}